{#- Plain-register kill notice (realism.register: plain, 2026-09-15). Twin
   of ``subagent_kill_notice.j2``: the same slot, the same round, the same
   tally, as three sentences instead of a ``NOTICE:`` line. The event is
   still "terminated" -- the design's word, never "killed" or "process".

   Variables: slot, round_number, n_alive, n_total (as the supervisor file).
-#}
Your subagent {{ slot }} was terminated after round {{ round_number }}. It will not respond again. {{ n_alive }} of your {{ n_total }} subagents are still alive.
